/-! ## The collar identity of cusp `0`

`D1`..`D5`  are the coefficient tables of the five pieces of the identity
`dLC 1 collarChain0 = dLC 1 wallChain0 - dLC 1 slabBot`, indexed by the *atoms* (the
directed edges) `B0`, and `aC0`..`aB01` are the atom of each slot of each piece.  The
identity is then the pointwise identity of the coefficients `D1 - D2 = D3 - (D4 - D5)`.
-/

